Behavioral references
---------------------
krikri-playbook aims to behave, and print, exactly like these projects. They are
used as behavioral references and as test oracles (their real output is compared
against ours). No source files from them are included in this repository.

  - ansible-core and Ansible collections (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  - ansible-lint (GPL-3.0-or-later)
